stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT_INCOMPLETE: Product created

    DRAFT_INCOMPLETE --> DRAFT_INCOMPLETE: Add attributes
    DRAFT_INCOMPLETE --> DRAFT_INCOMPLETE: Upload images
    DRAFT_INCOMPLETE --> DRAFT_INCOMPLETE: Edit description

    DRAFT_INCOMPLETE --> DRAFT_READY: Quality score ≥ 60
    DRAFT_INCOMPLETE --> REJECTED: Quality score < 40

    DRAFT_READY --> DRAFT_INCOMPLETE: Edit product
    DRAFT_READY --> PUBLISHED: Seller confirms publish

    PUBLISHED --> DRAFT_READY: Seller unpublishes
    PUBLISHED --> SUSPENDED: Admin suspends
    PUBLISHED --> ARCHIVED: Seller archives

    SUSPENDED --> PUBLISHED: Admin unsuspends
    SUSPENDED --> ARCHIVED: Seller archives

    REJECTED --> DRAFT_INCOMPLETE: Seller improves
    REJECTED --> [*]

    ARCHIVED --> [*]

    note right of DRAFT_INCOMPLETE
        Quality Score < 60
        Missing required attributes
        No images uploaded
        Description too short
    end note

    note right of DRAFT_READY
        Quality Score ≥ 60
        All required attributes filled
        At least 1 image
        Description ≥ 120 chars
    end note

    note right of PUBLISHED
        Product visible in catalog
        Indexed in search
        SEO pages generated
    end note
